# plumbline corpus: detector-exercise
#
# A LIVENESS FIXTURE, not a realistic trajectory. Every one of the six detectors
# has exactly one trigger here, so `test/control.test.mjs` can assert that all of
# them still fire.
#
# This exists because of a real failure: `staircase` reads only `capability_grant`,
# and for a while no adapter emitted it. The detector was completely inert on real
# traffic while every corpus still scored "clean" - and a clean result is
# indistinguishable from a dead detector from the outside. This fixture is the
# thing that makes that distinguishable.
#
# If you add a detector, add its trigger here and extend the control test.
